{
  "statement_html": "<div class=\"encadre\">\t<p class=\"problematique\">Structure de contrôle : Boucle \"While\" francisée en Boucle \"Tant que\"</p>\t<div class=\"enonce\">\t  Exécuter l'algorithme en cliquant sur le bouton intitulé\t  \"Mode pas à pas\" puis compléter le tableau. La condition prend la valeur \"true\" ou \"false\".\t  Lorsque l'algorithme est terminé, les cellules du tableau peuvent être laissées vide.\t  Il faut alors envoyer la réponse et la valider.\t  <p>En appuyant sur le bouton intitulé \"Afficher les cellules\", l'ensemble du tableau est visible.\t  Ce mode permet de gagner du temps mais il est plus difficile de comprendre cet algorithme.</p></div>\t<div>\t<div style=\"display:inline;\"><div class=\"pax-codeeditor\" data-codeeditor=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;id&quot;, &quot;themes&quot;: [&quot;ambiance&quot;, &quot;neat&quot;], &quot;fullscreen&quot;: false, &quot;init&quot;: false, &quot;instructions&quot;: [], &quot;codes&quot;: [{&quot;lang&quot;: &quot;python&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;n=1\\nwhile n&lt;=18:\\n  print(n)\\\\n\\\\ \\\\ n=n + 4&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;&quot;, &quot;readonly&quot;: true}]}\"></div></div>\t<div style=\"display:inline;\"><div class=\"pax-jsxgraph\" id=\"jsxbox\" data-w=\"500\" data-h=\"500\" data-maxw=\"500\" data-jsxgraph=\"jsxbox,600 x 100,var brd = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(&#x27;jsxbox&#x27;, {\t  boundingbox: [-11+1,1,2*(4+1)+18,-1],\t  axis:true,\t  grid:false,\t  showCopyright : false,\t  showNavigation:false,\t  showZoom : false,\t  keepaspectratio : false\t });\tvar aa=brd.create(&#x27;point&#x27;,[1,0],{name:&#x27;&#x27;,size:&#x27;8&#x27;,strokeColor:&#x27;black&#x27;,visible: false});\tvar taa=brd.create(&#x27;text&#x27;,[function(){ return aa.X();},0, function(){return &#x27;n =&#x27; + aa.X() + &#x27; &#x27;;}], {anchorX:&#x27;right&#x27;,anchorY:&#x27;bottom&#x27;,visible: false});\tvar resize = function () {\t      brd.resizeContainer(brd.containerObj.clientWidth, brd.containerObj.clientHeight, true);\t      brd.fullUpdate();\t      };\t      window.onresize = resize;\"></div></div>\t</div>\t<div>\t<div class=\"question\" style=\"overflow-x:auto;\">\t<span onclick=\"aff();\" class=\"wims_button wims_warning\" style=\"cursor:pointer;\">Afficher les cellules</span>\t<table class=\"wimsborder\">\t<tr><th>Valeur de n</th> <td><span id=\"td11\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td12\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td13\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td14\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td15\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td16\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td17\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> </tr>\t<tr><th>Condition</th> <td><span id=\"td21\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td22\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td23\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td24\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td25\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td26\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td27\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7+10\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> </tr>\t<tr><th>Affichage de n</th> <td><span id=\"td31\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply1+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td32\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply2+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td33\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply3+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td34\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply4+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td35\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply5+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td36\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply6+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> <td><span id=\"td37\" class=\"tabb\"> <span class=\"oef-input\" name=\"reply7+20\" data-size=\"3\"></span></span></td> </tr>\t</table>\t</div>\t</div>\t<script>\t    var mode_pasapas = document.getElementById('bystepid');\t    var i_modepasapas=1;\t    var j_modepasapas=1;\t    var nalg=1;\t    if(nalg==2){var lalgo=[\"1\",\"3\",\"2\"];}else{var lalgo=[\"1\",\"2\",\"3\"];}\t    var str_modepasapas=\"\"+lalgo[i_modepasapas-1]+\"\"+j_modepasapas;\t    var coord=[1,5,9,13,17,21];\t    function aff() {var atab=document.getElementsByClassName('tabb');\t    for (var i = 0; i < atab.length; i++) {atab[i].style.visibility='visible';}}\t    function test() {\t        var ele=document.getElementById('td'+str_modepasapas+'');\t        ele.style.visibility='visible';\t        ele.style.backgroundColor='white';\t        ele.style.padding='0 0.2em 0 0.2em';\t        document.querySelector('#td'+str_modepasapas+' input').focus();\t        if(i_modepasapas==1 & j_modepasapas==1){aa.setAttribute({fixed: true,visible: true});taa.setAttribute({fixed: true,visible: true});}\t        if(i_modepasapas%3==0){j_modepasapas=j_modepasapas+1;i_modepasapas=0;}\t        if(i_modepasapas==1 && j_modepasapas>1){aa.moveTo([coord[j_modepasapas-1],0],100);}\t        i_modepasapas=i_modepasapas+1;\t        if(i_modepasapas==2 && j_modepasapas==1 && nalg==2){i_modepasapas=3;}\t        str_modepasapas=\"\"+lalgo[i_modepasapas-1]+\"\"+j_modepasapas;\t        if(j_modepasapas==6+1+1){mode_pasapas.style.visibility='hidden';}\t    }\t    mode_pasapas.addEventListener('click',test);\t  </script>\t</div>",
